Remove Dead Tracks v1.1AppleScript for iTunes 2Find more free AppleScriptsand info on writing your ownat Doug's AppleScriptshttp://www.malcolmadams.com/itunes/This script surveys the selected playlist for tracks whose files cannot be located on a local drive -- generally, these are the tracks in the playlist with "!" next to their track names -- and asks to delete those tracks en masse from the playlist.This script is not capable of deleting files.However, you are advised to use this script thoughtfully and cautiously.The latest version of this scripts ignores streams that may be mixed in with your sound file tracks.I make no guarantees to this scripts effectiveness on your computer. This script is capable of making changes to data. If this makes you aprehensive please use copies of your files.My name is Doug Adamsdougadams@mac.com